Package: notepadpp-linux
Version: 1.0.0
Section: editors
Priority: optional
Architecture: all
Maintainer: NotepadPP Linux Maintainers <maintainers@example.com>
Depends: python3, python3-gi, gir1.2-gtk-3.0, gir1.2-gtksource-3.0
Description: Notepad++-style text editor for Debian and Ubuntu
 Lightweight multi-tab text editor with syntax highlighting,
 find/replace, session restore, and desktop integration.
